        "subheading_3": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I grew up in Houston, studied accounting at night and spent my early twenties working two jobs and still running out before payday.</p><p>The fix was not more money. It was knowing where it went, deciding in advance and making saving automatic. I wrote it down for friends, then for a few thousand strangers, and then for this book.</p>"
